### Cancelamento de pagamento / assinatura

### 1. Caso principal — cancela a assinatura ativa (pagamento APPROVED)
POST {{host}}/billings/payment/68f2c1a94b3d0e1a77c9d512/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### 2. Cancela um Pix/boleto emitido e ainda não pago (PENDING)
POST {{host}}/billings/payment/68f2c1a94b3d0e1a77c9d513/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### 3. Erro esperado 409 — pagamento já cancelado antes
POST {{host}}/billings/payment/68f2c1a94b3d0e1a77c9d514/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### 4. Erro esperado 403 — pagamento de outro usuário
POST {{host}}/billings/payment/68f2c1a94b3d0e1a77c9d515/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### 5. Erro esperado 404 — id que não existe na coleção
POST {{host}}/billings/payment/000000000000000000000000/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### 6. Erro esperado 400 — id fora do formato ObjectID
POST {{host}}/billings/payment/nao-e-um-objectid/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### 7. Erro esperado 401 — sem token
POST {{host}}/billings/payment/68f2c1a94b3d0e1a77c9d512/cancel

### 8. Conferência — a lista deve trazer o pagamento com status 6 (CANCELLED)
GET {{host}}/billings/payments
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
